    <note type="translation" xml:lang="en">Arqamās al-Jāmūs al-Yashbakī, whose nisbah is derived from Yashbak al-Shaʿbānī. He was one of the 'Asharāt (ten-officers) during the reign of al-Ẓāhir Jaqmaq. He died in Cairo at the end of Rabīʿ al-Thānī in the year 863, being of advanced age.</note>
